Package: daisyr.studio
Title: Shiny Studio for the daisyr Daisy Workflow
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohamed Jabloun", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "daisyr@example.com")
Description: Graphical interface for the daisyr package. Provides a Shiny
    studio to set up Daisy projects, edit parameters, run
    simulations, define objective functions, and run calibration,
    sensitivity analysis, and space-filling design workflows.
